{"seq":2,"slug":"fan-out-fan-in","title":"Fan-Out/Fan-In 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/fan-out-fan-in","wordCount":589,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"fan-out-fan-in-模式\">Fan-Out/Fan-In 模式</h1><p>当 Pipeline 中某个 stage 成为瓶颈（比如 CPU 密集计算或高延迟 I/O），单个 goroutine 无法消化上游吞吐时，Fan-Out/Fan-In 模式自然登场：将单源数据分发（fan-out）给多个并行 worker 处理，再将结果汇聚（fan-in）到一条输出 channel。这是 Go 生产系统中使用频率最高的并发拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SRC[&quot;源 channel&quot;] --&gt; W1[&quot;Worker 1&quot;]&#10;    SRC --&gt; W2[&quot;Worker 2&quot;]&#10;    SRC --&gt; W3[&quot;Worker 3&quot;]&#10;    W1 --&gt; MERGE[&quot;Fan-In 合并&quot;]&#10;    W2 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    W3 --&gt; MERGE&#10;    MERGE --&gt; OUT[&quot;输出 channel&quot;]\">graph LR\n    SRC[\"源 channel\"] --&gt; W1[\"Worker 1\"]\n    SRC --&gt; W2[\"Worker 2\"]\n    SRC --&gt; W3[\"Worker 3\"]\n    W1 --&gt; MERGE[\"Fan-In 合并\"]\n    W2 --&gt; MERGE\n    W3 --&gt; MERGE\n    MERGE --&gt; OUT[\"输出 channel\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fan-Out</td>\n<td>多个 goroutine 从同一个 channel 读取</td>\n<td>channel 自动互斥分发，无需额外锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fan-In</td>\n<td>多个 channel 的输出合并到一个 channel</td>\n<td>需要 WaitGroup 或计数来确定何时 close</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界 Fan-Out</td>\n<td>用 semaphore 限制并发 worker 数</td>\n<td>防止资源耗尽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fan-out-多-worker-共享输入\">Fan-Out：多 worker 共享输入</h2><p>Go 的 channel 天然支持多消费者——从同一个 channel 接收的多个 goroutine 会互斥地获取数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func fanOut(ctx context.Context, in &lt;-chan Task, numWorkers int) []&lt;-chan Result {&#10;    workers := make([]&lt;-chan Result, numWorkers)&#10;    for i := 0; i &lt; numWorkers; i++ {&#10;        workers[i] = worker(ctx, in)&#10;    }&#10;    return workers&#10;}&#10;&#10;func worker(ctx context.Context, in &lt;-chan Task) &lt;-chan Result {&#10;    out := make(chan Result)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer close(out)&#10;        for task := range in {&#10;            select {&#10;            case out &lt;- process(task):&#10;            case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return out&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fanOut</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">numWorkers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, numWorkers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numWorkers; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        workers[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, in)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：多个 worker 从同一个 in channel 读取时，每条数据只会被一个 worker 处理——这是 channel 的互斥语义保证的，不是复制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fan-in-合并多路输出\">Fan-In：合并多路输出</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func fanIn(ctx context.Context, channels ...&lt;-chan Result) &lt;-chan Result {&#10;    out := make(chan Result)&#10;    var wg sync.WaitGroup&#10;&#10;    for _, ch := range channels {&#10;        wg.Add(1)&#10;        go func(c &lt;-chan Result) {&#10;            defer wg.Done()&#10;            for v := range c {&#10;                select {&#10;                case out &lt;- v:&#10;                case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                    return&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }(ch)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    go func() {&#10;        wg.Wait()&#10;        close(out)&#10;    }()&#10;&#10;    return out&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fanIn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ...&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channels {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }(ch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"有界-fan-out-semaphore-限流\">有界 Fan-Out：Semaphore 限流</h2><p>无限制的 fan-out 在高负载下会创建大量 goroutine，导致内存膨胀和调度压力。用 buffered channel 作为信号量（semaphore）控制并发度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func boundedFanOut(ctx context.Context, tasks []Task, maxConcurrency int) &lt;-chan Result {&#10;    results := make(chan Result, len(tasks))&#10;    sem := make(chan struct{}, maxConcurrency)&#10;    var wg sync.WaitGroup&#10;&#10;    for _, task := range tasks {&#10;        wg.Add(1)&#10;        sem &lt;- struct{}{} // 获取令牌（满则阻塞）&#10;        go func(t Task) {&#10;            defer wg.Done()&#10;            defer func() { &lt;-sem }() // 释放令牌&#10;&#10;            select {&#10;            case results &lt;- process(t):&#10;            case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;            }&#10;        }(task)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    go func() {&#10;        wg.Wait()&#10;        close(results)&#10;    }()&#10;&#10;    return results&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> boundedFanOut</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span styl