style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sem }() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 释放令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能对比\">性能对比</h2><p>以处理 10000 个 HTTP 请求为基准（每请求 50ms 延迟）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>总耗时</th>\n<th>峰值 goroutine</th>\n<th>峰值内存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>串行</td>\n<td>500s</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无限 fan-out</td>\n<td>0.05s</td>\n<td>10000</td>\n<td>180MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界 fan-out (N=100)</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>25MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界 fan-out (N=500)</td>\n<td>1s</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>55MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际生产中 N 的选择取决于下游容量：数据库连接池大小、外部 API 的速率限制、目标服务的 QPS 上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理策略\">错误处理策略</h2><p>Fan-Out/Fan-In 的错误处理有两种主流策略：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：收集所有错误</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Result struct {&#10;    Value string&#10;    Err   error&#10;}&#10;// 消费者检查每个 Result.Err\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Err   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费者检查每个 Result.Err</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：首错取消（errgroup 风格）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"g, ctx := errgroup.WithContext(ctx)&#10;for _, task := range tasks {&#10;    t := task&#10;    g.Go(func() error {&#10;        return process(ctx, t)&#10;    })&#10;}&#10;if err := g.Wait(); err != nil {&#10;    // 第一个错误触发 ctx 取消，其余 worker 感知后退出&#10;    return err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">g, ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errgroup.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tasks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 第一个错误触发 ctx 取消，其余 worker 感知后退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"顺序保障\">顺序保障</h2><p>Fan-Out/Fan-In 默认不保证输出顺序（哪个 worker 先完成先输出）。需要保序时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type IndexedResult struct {&#10;    Index int&#10;    Value Result&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 收集后按 Index 排序&#10;results := make([]Result, len(tasks))&#10;for ir := range fanInCh {&#10;    results[ir.Index] = ir.Value&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IndexedResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Value </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 收集后按 Index 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tasks))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fanInCh {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results[ir.Index] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ir.Value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Fan-Out = 多 worker 从同一 channel 读（channel 互斥分发）</li>\n<li>Fan-In = 多路 channel 合并到一条（WaitGroup 协调 close）</li>\n<li>有界 Fan-Out 用 buffered channel 做 semaphore，控制并发上界</li>\n<li>errgroup 是首错取消型 fan-out 的标准实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"worker-pool\">Worker Pool 模式</a>——将 Fan-Out 的「按任务启动 goroutine」改为「固定 goroutine 池消费任务队列」，更适合长生命周期服务</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../go-service-engineering/errors-and-logging/error-handling-wrapping\">Go 服务工程 · 错误处理</a>——Fan-Out 中的错误需要 wrap context 后向上传递，具体的 error wrapping 约定参见该文档</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Fan-Out/Fan-In 模式","id":"fan-out-fan-in-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fan-Out：多 worker 共享输入","id":"fan-out-多-worker-共享输入"},{"level":2,"text":"Fan-In：合并多路输出","id":"fan-in-合并多路输出"},{"level":2,"text":"有界 Fan-Out：Semaphore 限流","id":"有界-fan-out-semaphore-限流"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比","id":"性能对比"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理策略","id":"错误处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"顺序保障","id":"顺序保障"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Pipeline 流水线模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/pipeline"},"next":{"title":"Worker Pool 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/worker-pool"}}